<h2>Your username in Saisonmanager has changed</h2>

<p>Hello<%= " #{@first_name}" if @first_name %>,</p>

<p>
  we have changed the username of your Saisonmanager account. Accounts of guest
  referees now use the surname instead of a number.
</p>

<p>
  Your new username: <strong><%= @username %></strong><br />
  Your previous username: <%= @previous_user_name %>
</p>

<p>Your password is unchanged. Please use the new username the next time you sign in:</p>

<p>
  <a href="<%= @link %>"><%= @link %></a>
</p>

<p>
  If you have any questions, please contact the referee committee of Floorball
  Deutschland (<a href="mailto:rsk@floorball.de">rsk@floorball.de</a>).
</p>
